Subject: [PATCH] feat(indexing): pure index-lag evaluator with a
 mandatory host threshold (S1, G236-6)

New module, no I/O and no runtime activation; worker_status unchanged.
Distinguishes index health, canonical coverage and ageing; unknown or future
dates never yield an ageing verdict. 12 tests, including the S1 case on real
journal rows (worker_status PENDING, evaluator LAGGING).

